{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the idyllic yet enigmatic Yellow Creek, nestled in Clearwater County, Colorado \u2014 where Julian and Serena strive to rekindle their love after what was only a bad dream (Serena: Dark Confessions). Though it was nothing more than a nightmare, its dark imagery still haunts Serena in her sleep, and she cannot easily shake it off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaving behind a stormy past, in which Serena, tormented by doubt, suspected Julian of infidelity and asked a friend to secretly test his loyalty, the couple now seeks a fresh start. Though Julian proved faithful, the ordeal shook the very foundations of their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, they\u2019ve decided to move to Yellow Creek, the hometown of Serena\u2019s mother, hoping that a peaceful life by the lake will heal old wounds. Julian works to revive a local workshop while Serena channels her passion into interior design. Yet beneath the town\u2019s serene surface, secrets still stir \u2014 including the hidden romance of Margaret, Serena\u2019s mother and proprietress of the Lakeview Tavern, which may finally unveil the true identity of Serena\u2019s father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060650/extras/d4f221c18c2f949baa1f2a8feebbd6cf.poster.avif?t=1759911202\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060650/extras/d4f221c18c2f949baa1f2a8feebbd6cf.webm?t=1759911202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060650/extras/d4f221c18c2f949baa1f2a8feebbd6cf.mp4?t=1759911202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cunning Dr. Evelyn Hart offers therapy to mend their hearts but plants seeds of perilous temptation. Meanwhile, the provocative duo Zoe and Sophia wreak havoc with their seductive schemes. Virginia, the steadfast policewoman, upholds the law and protects Yellow Creek\u2019s residents, yet remains blind to the shadows lurking within. Meet Cindy, the lively tavern waitress, balancing her work with a romance with Tyler, a skilled but roguish construction worker whose naughty streak threatens to unravel their bond. Navigate a web of love, deception, and family secrets in this captivating erotic visual novel where your choices forge your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060650/extras/67bae4a5dc0e78a721730f0a60d696b6.poster.avif?t=1759911202\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060650/extras/67bae4a5dc0e78a721730f0a60d696b6.webm?t=1759911202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060650/extras/67bae4a5dc0e78a721730f0a60d696b6.mp4?t=1759911202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Visual Novel</strong>: Experience an adventure in Yellow Creek, blending romance, drama, and eroticism with stunning 3D renders and animated scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Choices &amp; Stats</strong>: Build <strong>FRIENDSHIP</strong> and <strong>DESIRE</strong> with characters like Serena, Margaret, and others. Your decisions unlock unique story paths, from heartfelt love to risky temptations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Characters</strong>: Encounter a cast of vivid personalities, from the loyal Serena to the badboy Tyler, the cunning Dr. Hart, and the provocative Zoe and Sophia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erotic &amp; Emotional Depth</strong>: Engage in passionate scenes (optional, consensual) and unravel family secrets, like Serena\u2019s search for her father, in a narrative of love and redemption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong>: Shape your story with choices leading to a happy marriage, open relationships, or dramatic confrontations, ensuring high replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060650/extras/2787c700e83bf92483fa34543cb5392c.poster.avif?t=1759911202\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060650/extras/2787c700e83bf92483fa34543cb5392c.webm?t=1759911202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060650/extras/2787c700e83bf92483fa34543cb5392c.mp4?t=1759911202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serena: Yellow Creek\u00a0reinvents the beloved series, moving away from the dark tones of Dark Confessions to a romantic, thrilling tale of new beginnings. Will you guide Julian and Serena to lasting love, or fall prey to the temptations of Clearwater County? Dive into Yellow Creek and forge your path!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060650?t=1759911202","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060650/f4a42f0b9d99de21e7a630cdf28f332feec48982/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759911202","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.